msgid "Sea"
msgstr "Mar"

msgctxt "0xcc2c98f9"
msgid "Smith"
msgstr "Smith"

msgctxt "0x558d0540"
msgid "Smith grew up in Cleveland and was never happy unless he was fixing a piece of machinery. Long before the war in Europe, he was stationed as a mechanic in an Artillery Division for several years."
msgstr "Smith cresceu em Cleveland e só era feliz consertando alguma máquina. Bem antes da guerra na Europa, serviu vários anos como mecânico numa divisão de artilharia."

msgctxt "0x350bb7a5"
